OL,3,AMove faster to solve climate
OL,4,Achallenges, Prince William says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince of Wales has warned that the
OL,7,Fworld needs to move faster to solve the
OL,8,Fbiggest climate challenges.
OL,10,FSpeaking exclusively to the BBC, Prince
OL,11,FWilliam called for a greater sense of
OL,12,Furgency around ways to repair the
OL,13,Fplanet.
OL,15,F"We're not moving fast enough," William
OL,16,Fsaid. "We need more businesses,
OL,17,Finvestors and leaders to step up, back
OL,18,Fwhat works and help bring these
OL,19,Fsolutions to scale."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
